//! TCP protocol implementation — connection state machine, segment I/O, and extensions.
//!
//! **RFC:** [RFC 9293](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9293.html) (core TCP).
//!
//! This module is the Moose kernel's TCP stack. [`TcpDriver`] owns all connections;
//! each [`TcpControlBlock`] holds sequence/state variables. Optional behaviors
//! (SACK, Timestamps, ECN, CWV, pacing, CUBIC, etc.) live in submodules with
//! structure definitions separated from the send/receive logic in this file.

